<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>0311 關東秘境自駕｜真實景點與訂房確認版</title>
    <style>
        :root { --primary: #1f3d3a; --secondary: #d4a373; --bg: #f4f7f6; --nissan: #c3002f; }
        body { font-family: "PingFang TC", "Microsoft JhengHei", sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.6; }
        header { background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.6), rgba(0,0,0,0.6)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493976040374-85c8e12f0c0e?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop'); background-size: cover; background-position: center; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 60px 20px; }
        header h1 { font-size: 2.2em; margin: 0; text-shadow: 2px 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
        .drive-btn { display: inline-flex; width: 90%; max-width: 320px; justify-content: center; background: #34A853; color: white; padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); transition: 0.3s; }
        .drive-btn:hover { background: #2b8a43; }
        .container { max-width: 900px; margin: -40px auto 60px; padding: 0 15px; }
        
        /* NISSAN 租車資訊專屬看板 */
        .rent-card { background: #fff; border-radius: 15px; padding: 25px; margin-bottom: 30px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border-top: 6px solid var(--nissan); }
        .rent-title { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 1.3em; font-weight: bold; color: #1f3d3a; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .rent-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 15px; }
        .rent-item { background: #f8faf9; padding: 12px 15px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 3px solid var(--nissan); }
        .rent-label { font-size: 0.8em; color: #666; font-weight: bold; }
        .rent-value { font-size: 1em; color: #1f3d3a; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 2px; }
        
        .day-box { background: white; border-radius: 15px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 40px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .day-header { background: var(--primary); color: white; padding: 18px 25px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
        .date-tag { background: var(--secondary); color: white; padding: 2px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.9em; font-weight: bold; margin-right: 10px; }
        .stay-info { font-size: 0.85em; opacity: 0.9; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }
        
        /* 圖片庫排版 */
        .image-gallery { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr; gap: 6px; padding: 6px; background: #eee; }
        .main-img { width: 100%; height: 280px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 6px; background: #e2e8f0; }
        .side-images { display: grid; grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr; gap: 6px; }
        .side-images img { width: 100%; height: 137px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 6px; background: #e2e8f0; }
        
        .content { padding: 25px; }
        .timeline { margin-bottom: 25px; }
        .event { border-left: 3px solid var(--secondary); padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px; position: relative; }
        .event::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: -9px; top: 5px; width: 14px; height: 14px; background: white; border: 3px solid var(--secondary); border-radius: 50%; }
        .time { font-weight: bold; color: var(--primary); margin-right: 10px; display: inline-block; width: 45px; }
        
        .recommend-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-top: 20px; }
        .card { padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 0.9em; border-left: 5px solid; }
        .eat { background: #fff1f0; border-left-color: #ff4d4f; }
        .secret { background: #f6ffed; border-left-color: #52c41a; }
        .warning { background: #fff7e6; border-left-color: #faad14; }
        
        .map-section { margin-top: 25px; text-align: center; }
        .map-btn { display: inline-block; width: 100%; background: #4285F4; color: white; padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; transition: 0.3s; }
        .map-btn:hover { background: #2a6bcc; }

        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            header h1 { font-size: 2.8em; }
            .day-header { flex-direction: row; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
            .recommend-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; }
            .rent-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; }
            .map-btn { width: auto; padding: 12px 40px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>🚗 0726 關東秘境自駕手冊</h1>
