    <div class="day-box">
        <div class="day-header">
            <h2><span class="date-tag">8/21 Fri</span> Day 1｜初抵日本 ➔ 成田山深度遊</h2>
            <span class="stay-info">🏠 宿：成田東武機場飯店</span>
        </div>
        <div class="image-gallery">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542224566-6e85f2e6772f?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" class="main-img" alt="" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/600x400/e2e8f0/475569?text=Narita+Airport';">
            <div class="side-images">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605342416049-53e77876a4ba?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/600x400/e2e8f0/475569?text=Naritasan+Temple';">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1625938144755-652e08e359b7?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/600x400/e2e8f0/475569?text=Unagi+Rice';">
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="timeline">
                <div class="event"><span class="time">11:15</span> 飛機順利降落成田機場，辦理入境手續與提取行李</div>
                <div class="event"><span class="time">13:00</span> 搭乘飯店 Shuttle Bus 前往「成田東武機場飯店」寄存行李</div>
                <div class="event"><span class="time">14:00</span> 利用接駁車前往 JR 成田站，步行至**成田山新勝寺與表參道**</div>
                <div class="event"><span class="time">16:30</span> **表參道晚餐**：享用著名的碳烤鰻魚飯 (推薦：川豐或駿河屋)</div>
                <div class="event"><span class="time">19:30</span> 搭乘接駁大巴返回成田東武飯店休息，調整體力</div>
            </div>
            <div class="recommend-grid">
                <div class="card eat"><b>🍴 美食</b><br>川豐/駿河屋鰻魚飯、表參道紅薯點心</div>
                <div class="card secret"><b>🌿 溫馨提醒</b><br>第一天不需提重物自駕，利用大眾運輸與接駁車最輕鬆。</div>
                <div class="card warning"><b>⚠️ 自駕準備</b><br>今晚整理好台灣駕照正本與日文譯本，明早準備取車.</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="day-box">
        <div class="day-header">
            <h2><span class="date-tag">8/22 Sat</span> Day 2｜取車 ➔ 茨城海岸 ➔ 宇都宮</h2>
            <span class="stay-info">🏠 宿：東日本宇都宮酒店</span>
        </div>
        <div class="image-gallery">
