                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1582208993353-2721ca164639?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/600x400/e2e8f0/475569?text=Utsunomiya+Gyoza';">
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="timeline">
                <div class="event"><span class="time">09:15</span> 有長輩小孩推薦搭計程車直接前往 JR 成田站西口 (約 15 分鐘)</div>
                <div class="event"><span class="time">10:00</span> **NISSAN 成田站前店** 準時取車，完成自駕手續</div>
