        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="timeline">
                <div class="event"><span class="time">08:00</span> 宇都宮飯店出發，經日光宇都宮道路前往日光</div>
                <div class="event"><span class="time">09:30</span> 日光東照宮參拜：欣賞陽明門、眠貓、三猿</div>
