            </div>
            <div class="map-section">
                <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/U39RqkBrhJvQcB4g7" target="_blank" class="map-btn">📍 開啟 Day 5 Google Maps 導覽</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="day-box">
        <div class="day-header">
